emFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI完成150亿美元新一轮融资，估值升至1.25万亿美元</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Edge0 开源 145B 端侧模型，实现个人电脑本地流畅运行</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Anthropic启动IPO获六倍超额认购，英伟达拟斥资100亿美元参与私募配售</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌联合三星等品牌发布Gemini智能眼镜，起售价395美元并引入远程锁机隐私条款</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/27234ec0b3f822767f2f5a2fd87eb889.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌于11月12日正式开启Intelligent Eyewear系列智能眼镜预售，起售价为395美元。该产品由谷歌提供Gemini AI底层能力与系统支持，三星、Gentle Monster及Warby Parker负责硬件形态、工业设计与光学镜架。作为谷歌在具身智能与穿戴设备领域的最新布局，该产品标志着Gemini助手正式落地端侧可穿戴硬件。针对公众关注的隐私问题，谷歌在服务条款中开创性引入“双向隐私”规定，明确禁止绕过系统机制进行违规拍摄或滥用设备功能。谷歌官方强调，对于违反隐私保护机制的用户，公司保留远程锁机的权力，旨在通过技术与制度双重手段，为智能穿戴设备的隐私边界划定底线，平衡科技便利与公众权益。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">腾讯发布实时语音模型Hy Realtime，支持Agentic工具调用与唱歌功能</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/95a0012445ce86041be0d1531a50a629.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">腾讯混元正式发布全新实时语音模型Hy Realtime，该模型在语音理解、指令遵循及拟人化表达方面表现优异，并新增Agentic工具调用与唱歌功能，具备联网搜索与执行任务能力。目前，Hy Realtime已集成至元宝语音通话及腾讯客服等内部产品中，显著提升了数亿用户的交互体验。腾讯计划近期通过腾讯云以API形式向外部开发者开放该模型能力。此次发布标志着腾讯将自研语音技术从内部场景向外部生态拓展，旨在为开发者提供更具交互深度与任务处理能力的语音解决方案，改变此前依赖第三方语音能力的局面。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI完成150亿美元新一轮融资，估值升至1.25万亿美元</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/582a5a22738f6362a99e79de2688fac9.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI近期敲定新一轮150亿美元私募融资，融资前估值达到1.25万亿美元。此轮融资被定性为“机会性融资”，旨在为2027年启动的IPO储备资金，以应对模型训练、推理服务及数据中心建设带来的高额重资产投入。财务数据显示，OpenAI今年第三季度营收约100亿美元，环比增长近50%，但同期运营亏损达109亿美元，调整后营业利润率为-109%，仍处于亏损状态。此次融资正值行业竞争加剧期，Anthropic计划于11月19日进行IPO，估值上限约1.4万亿美元。随着两家头部AI公司相继走向公开市场，投资者将通过财报直接评估其营收增速与烧钱效率，这对行业资本流向及LLM商业化路径具有重要参考意义。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Edge0 开源 145B 端侧模型，实现个人电脑本地流畅运行</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/bc8a0302d9c76c58b966aafbbb70590e.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">开源项目 Edge0 正式发布并开源 Edge0-145B 与 Edge0-120B 模型，及配套推理框架与部署工具。作为全球首个可在个人电脑本地运行的 1450 亿参数模型，Edge0-145B 通过稀疏专家架构（MoE）、端侧协同训练及三层存储流水线技术，将内存占用降低 40% 至 60%。在搭载苹果 M 系列芯片或 RTX 4090/5090 的设备上，其峰值内存占用仅 29GB，解码速度超 80 tokens/s，支持 128K 至 256K 上下文。该模型在 DeepSWE1.1、GPQA-Diamond 等基准测试中表现优异，编程、推理及智能体能力对标云端前沿模型，可独立完成复杂本地工作流，如 3D 建模、代码开发及电路设计。目前，模型权重已在 Hugging Face 开源，推理框架与部署指南同步</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Anthropic启动IPO获六倍超额认购，英伟达拟斥资100亿美元参与私募配售</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/b71cbb1ef0b58e51f834cbf694c2fb5b.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Anthropic即将进行的IPO引发市场高度关注，认购订单已达可供股份数的约6倍，承销银行表示将优先照顾现有股东，新投资者面临砍单风险。此次融资规模巨大，Anthropic拟通过IPO募资最多644亿美元，并搭配260亿美元的私募配售，完全稀释后目标估值约1.4万亿美元。作为关键战略伙伴，英伟达计划在私募配售中认购约100亿美元。在运营数据方面，截至10月31日，Anthropic的营收运行率已达810亿美元，较9月底增长100亿美元。为进一步推动上市进程，Anthropic CEO达里奥·阿莫代伊将于11月13日与摩根大通CEO戴蒙进行直播。此次超额认购反映了资本市场对AI头部企业的强烈追捧，同时也凸显了英伟达在AI基础设施与模型生态布局中的深度绑定策略。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
